LGPL Relinking Notice
---------------------
WasFlash statically links FFmpeg, which is licensed under the GNU Lesser
General Public License version 2.1 or later (LGPL v2.1+). To satisfy the
LGPL's static linking requirement, WasFlash's compiled object files are
provided alongside each binary release. They are distributed as a .zip
